1. NETWORK INTERACTION AND SOURCE CODE AVAILABILITY:
If you modify this software or use it as part of a network service (SaaS, Web Application, API, Backend Service), you MUST prominently offer all users interacting with it through a network the opportunity to receive the Corresponding Source of your version at no charge. The source code must be disclosed under the terms of this AGPLv3 license.

